      "content": {
        "text": "You can now handle changing equal-efficiency teams with worker-days.\n\nWorkers × days = work.\nMore workers → fewer days for the same work.\nAt a team change, preserve the work already done and recompute only the remainder.\n\nUse this shortcut only when workers are equally efficient.",
